          "id": 2772644761,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I was away for the weekend, thanks for picking this up quickly!\n\nI tested the MR and it works great. I don't mind that it is done for all graphs at the same time, switching is easily done by pressing the U. One small annoyance is that the graph resets whenever U is pressed. Is it possible make the graph keep the current zoom-level and view on the graph when switching SI units on/off by pressing U?",
